The air felt different.
Thicker. Charged.
As if the veil between
earth and heaven
had grown thin.
The crowd sensed it.
The soldiers felt it.
Even the stones
seemed to hold their
breath.

* [The veil was thin.] -> veil_thin
* [Heaven touched earth.] -> heaven_earth

